    "details": "<p><strong>CoMemor is hiring for Operations Intern</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Company</strong></p>\n<p>CoMemor is seeking an Operations Intern to support the coordination and execution of work in the software and artificial intelligence industry. This fully remote opportunity is designed for candidates interested in how operational planning, event delivery, and clear information systems help technology teams work effectively. No prior experience is required; curiosity, reliability, and a willingness to learn are important. The internship offers flexible timing, an official certificate, and letters of recommendation upon successful completion.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Assist with planning and coordinating events, tracking timelines, tasks, and follow-ups.</li>\n<li>Create, update, and maintain dashboards that help teams monitor activities and progress.</li>\n<li>Organize operational information and keep records accurate and easy to access.</li>\n<li>Coordinate with teammates remotely, share status updates, and help identify outstanding action items.</li>\n<li>Support improvements to event and dashboard workflows based on team needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><stro",
