    "details": "<p><strong>Credit Curators is hiring for Digital Marketing &amp; SEO Intern!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Company</strong></p>\n<p>Credit Curators is seeking a Digital Marketing &amp; SEO Intern to contribute to practical online marketing projects. This remote opportunity is suited to someone who can work independently, communicate clearly, and make steady progress on agreed tasks. The internship runs for six months and offers flexible working hours alongside a part-time schedule.</p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Assist with search engine optimization activities aimed at strengthening online visibility.</li>\n<li>Support digital marketing projects, helping plan and carry out assigned work.</li>\n<li>Contribute to content optimization and monitor relevant performance indicators.</li>\n<li>Organize project tasks, share progress, and collaborate remotely with the team.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>At least one year of experience in digital marketing or SEO.</li>\n<li>Ability to take on freelance-style project tasks and deliver work to agreed timelines.</li>\n<li>Availability for approximately 2&ndash;3 hours per day, 5&ndash;6 days per w",
